  "prompt": "Create a 2D fantasy platformer called The Frozen Guardian.\n\nI am a warrior exploring a frozen temple surrounded by enchanted forest ruins.\n\nThe level begins with a platforming section featuring slippery ice, moving platforms, and dangerous falling icicles.\n\nEventually I enter a sealed arena containing one powerful ice guardian.\n\nThe guardian initially has a magical shield that prevents me from damaging it.\n\nInside the arena there are TWO magical switches. I must activate both switches to disable the guardian's shield.\n\nOnce the shield is disabled, I must fight the guardian. It should use projectile attacks and a charging attack.\n\nThe boss becomes more aggressive when its health drops below half.\n\nI win only after defeating the guardian.\n\nDo not add collectibles or ordinary enemies.\n\nUse appropriate ice and forest artwork, animated attacks, a visible boss health bar, shield-breaking effects, and clear visual feedback.",
